WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.680
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.440
The defeated are left with disgrace and frustration,

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.330
while new trials await the victors.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:12.920
Whether they advance or turn back, these warriors will face hell.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.510
These chains of heartless battles awaken the madness within them.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.500
Well then, maid of the underworld...

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.270
I'm all fired up now, so you'd better prepare yourself!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.760
Take that!

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.180
And that, and that, and that!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.180
Hey, wait!

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.610
How many times must I say it? This isn't the time to be fighting!

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:41.730
What are you saying?

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.830
Well then, you're frightened by my strength, aren't you?

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.020
You're trembling, aren't you?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.050
It seems that talking to you is pointless.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.380
I suppose I have no choice but to fight, then.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.580
Isn't that obvious? This is Queen's Blade, after all!

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:01.620
How strange...

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:06.520
I'm finally able to see the archangel Nanael-sama's fight, and yet...

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.970
it isn't being shown.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:12.570
Airi onee-chan...

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:21.060
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:27.690
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:41.120
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:48.040
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:54.380
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:01:54.380 --> 00:02:02.100
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:06.520
In order to become

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:11.690
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:15.780
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:23.040
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:29.080
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:36.090
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:49.060
Well then, I won't hold back!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.790
Now you're talking.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:55.900
No way!

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:07.330
Damn it!

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.140
You're wide open!

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.760
She's quicker than I thought.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.490
Eh?

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.680
So much is gone... I can't use my power like this!

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:32.430
As I thought, I don't have enough strength.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:35.960
I have no choice but to take life force from that angel.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.530
There are rumors that the essence of angels...

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.110
is revolting enough to be brought to death's door from drinking it, but...

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.660
With things like this, I have to finish this quickly.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.490
I must finish this now.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.760
I'll decide it with this blow!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.180
Certain kill, Holy Dive!

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.360
Vulgar spirits!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:12.060
How could something like that possibly work on an angel?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.370
Serves you right!

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:26.940
Huh?

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.060
I can't fly!

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.420
The next attack will decide everything.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:45.510
This is really pissing me off!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.530
You're kidding me!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.270
This match is mine!

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.070
Eh?

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.110
It seems as though this is all the time I have.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.700
Onee-chan!

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.880
I have no power left to take away your life force.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.680
I suppose this is my loss.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:18.690
Well, at least it's better than being petrified.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.070
It's all that little one's fault.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.570
He really did give me a lot of trouble.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.100
Farewell, Rana.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.310
Onee-chan...

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.850
Airi onee-chan...

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.410
I won, right?

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:54.670
Due to the annihilation of the opponent, Nanael is the victor.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:06.340
So she was so afraid of my strength that she disappeared?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.650
Well, I suppose it was to be expected.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.930
That made me hungry. Guess I'll eat some grapes when I get back!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:16.050
That was unexpected.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.270
You cannot handle that carelessly.

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:33.470
Really, that ghost girl disappeared in the middle of the match!

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:36.580
Really?! I bet <i>everything</i> on her!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.920
Give me a break!

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:40.770
Onee-chan!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.000
Piece of cake!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.430
Well, that's what happens when you challenge <i>me</i>!

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.930
I nimbly dodged my opponent's attacks...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.930
and finally used my ultimate technique, "Holy Dive", to finish her off!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:57.140
So that's how it was? Thank you for your hard work.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:01.560
Show me even more respect, and I'll save you!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:04.570
Yes. Oh, Nanael-sama?

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:07.650
That seems to have decreased considerably...

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:12.700
It's nothing! Come on, put more back into it!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.450
I'm all worn out.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:16.980
Ah, of course!

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:23.170
If I completely defeat the Queen, I'll make myself a male harem!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.840
Let's see... I'll make you the person in charge of looking after me!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.920
Thank you very much.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:33.220
All right! Here comes the unrivaled angel, Nanael-sama!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.680
Eh? She's not here?

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.610
Damn Ymir!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:45.140
What is she doing with my sword?

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:48.960
So it needs more heat, after all.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:52.790
If I use Steel Mountain's furnace,
I might be able to do something, but...

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.800
I don't have time to go back.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.450
That's...

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.370
You disappeared because of me.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:08.740
Onee-chan...

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.300
I thought it was you, Rana!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.550
Where's Cattleya?

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.220
Are you lost or something?

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.810
W-What!?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:25.810
I-I didn't do anything!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.490
I see. So that's what happened.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:37.180
So that's the reason Cattleya's fight wasn't relayed?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:40.150
Just what are you planning, Queen Aldra?

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.190
So what are you going to do?

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:43.830
Eh?!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:47.670
Your mother, as well as the other woman who was taking care of you, are gone.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.340
What are you going to do from now on?

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:52.260
What am I going to do?

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:57.380
Unfortunately, I won't take you in.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.970
I have to take care of myself.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:03.100
You're a child, and I sympathize with you.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:08.170
But if you're a man, you need to decide on how to live from now on.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.940
I'm sorry, but I'm busy.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:16.360
Well then, if I don't reforge Leina's sword somehow...

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.830
Was I a little too cold?

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.820
Please let me help!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.180
What did you say?

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:38.340
That sword was made by Mommy and Daddy.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:42.130
Leina-san just might be able to save them both!

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:45.020
Please let me help you reforge that sword!

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.940
Are you really prepared?

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.870
So she was defeated.

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:05.190
Elina...

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:09.010
Have you finished making the necessary preparations?

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.590
Of course, my Count.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:15.990
However, are Leina-sama and Claudette-sama fine with that?

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.280
It is no matter.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.890
If we do not take this opportunity, all will be for naught.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:20.550
Do you understand?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.420
Yes.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:02.390
It's been 12 years since then...

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.890
I must not fail. I will retake the throne with my own hands!

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.860
The problem lies with the fire.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:19.320
The great alchemist's steel cannot be forged without a strong fire.

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.960
It's hopeless like this.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.370
Say, what about powder from a magic stone?

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:26.580
A magic stone? What's that?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:31.970
At home, we sprinkled powder from magic stones over the charcoal to increase the intensity of the flames.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:35.100
That should work fine for alchemist's steel.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.850
Ah, wait a second!

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:41.010
This is Mommy's toolbox.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:44.940
She always likes to be prepared to take on repairs, so...

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.690
This is magic stone powder.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.360
I see, so this is it...

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.230
Please use this spear, as well.

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.820
B-But that's Cattleya's...

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:01.950
If it's useful to you, I think that would make Mommy happy.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.950
I see. Then I'll be sure to make good use of it.

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:15.130
Shizuka-san.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:19.050
I will not let your strong feelings go to waste.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:26.820
I will win Queen's Blade without question.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.960
Risty-dono?

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.780
I'm finally out!

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:12.610
I thought I was going to die for a second there.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:16.830
Sorry, but I'm leaving you behind, Menace.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:21.110
At any rate, I've discovered something nice.

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.670
I might be able to use this.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.340
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:38.840
You want to see the finished sword, don't you?

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.940
Did Cattleya-san also help?

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.840
I have a request.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.230
Amazing!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.280
Of course it is!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.810
Thank you, Ymir.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:04.590
Thanks to Rana's help, I was able to get enough heat.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:06.860
His tempering techniques are still a bit lacking...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.080
but if he devotes himself to it, I believe he'll become a fine blacksmith.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.500
This sword holds everyone's strong feelings, including yours, Rana.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.070
Thank you. I'll use this with great care.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:20.420
And I'll certainly rescue Cattleya-san.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.710
Listen, Melpha.

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:34.980
No matter what female ape I face, I will surely defeat them!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:37.490
Make sure to watch closely.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:38.890
You might learn a thing or two!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.400
Yes, I have faith in you.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:45.370
I will have the bath prepared for you when you return, in case you are dirtied by your battle.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.820
Oh, good thinking!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:50.030
Well then, I'm off!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.620
Come back safely.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.670
Huh?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.710
Isn't this the church's garden?

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:04.800
Ah!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.840
No way! Leina-chan!

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.210
Nanael...

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.550
Don't tell me you're my Queen's Blade opponent.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:14.100
Yay! I should have no problem defeating <i>you</i>!

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:20.520
Well, since we're old pals, I'll try not to hurt you too badly.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.020
Damn. That's right, there isn't enough divine milk.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.390
Is something wrong?

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.790
It's nothing.

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:29.220
Let's go!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:32.230
Yes, yes. I understand.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.090
Here I come, Nanael.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.020
The sword is light...

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:48.580
It's as if it's a part of my body!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.760
What's with her? When did she get so strong!?

00:15:57.630 --> 00:15:58.640
For real?

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:10.190
Nanael-sama?

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.240
Hey, just wait! Wait!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.900
What are you talking about? This is Queen's Blade.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.530
Haven't I helped you out a lot?

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:21.330
At least let me have my sword!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.000
Take it.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:31.810
That was close. I was too careless...

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.930
This might get worse and worse.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.610
A chance!

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:42.520
Take this!

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:44.980
Dragon Tail!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.460
What will you do? Continue?

00:16:56.460 --> 00:17:01.580
Of course! How could an elite angel bear to lose to someone like you?

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.210
You're the same as always.
Don't you understand your situation?

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:07.750
You ignorant! Just admit your defeat!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.100
I can't do that.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.920
Let's duel fair and square.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.600
Don't get so cocky, you female ape!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:16.840
You'll regret it if I get serious!

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.360
I give up!

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.240
Nanael-sama has... lost?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.910
Ymir, Rana, thank you.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:46.690
It feels like I managed to get much stronger because of this sword.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:48.050
Of course!

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:52.250
Combining alchemical steel with Steel Mountain's tempering techniques...

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.990
could only leave you with a masterpiece!

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.840
Therefore, I dub it the succession of Ewindel.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.380
What does that mean?

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.260
In dwarven tongue, it means "wind of triumph".

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:06.560
As its name implies, it will bring you victory in the battles to come.

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.650
I'll definitely win the next match!

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:14.440
That was on purpose! Completely intentional!

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:18.280
Or should I say that there's no meaning to an angel becoming Queen in the first place?

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:23.730
Well, I approved of Leina from the start, so I lost on purpose.

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:25.930
As one would expect of Nanael-sama!

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.250
What a benevolent lady you are!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:33.090
Right? Sometimes an angel has to do some dirty work, too.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:44.480
I just can't believe I lost to that female ape!

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:49.070
I've been looking for you, Ms. Angel.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.490
What the hell?

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:59.650
Oh, it's just soft and flabby pink.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.870
Wrong...

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:03.370
I'm the Assassin of Innumerable Changes, Melona.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:08.260
Yeah, yeah. The one who ran from my divinity in our previous bout, right?

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.430
I didn't run away!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:14.640
Speaking of which, what about you? Wasn't your fight today just awful?

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.710
Well, who cares about any of that?

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:22.220
I came here because I have a task for you.

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:25.140
It's for the sake of defeating Queen Aldra.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.070
It appears as though Vance has begun to make his move.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:33.560
So it seems.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.220
In the end, he is insignificant...

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:39.400
yet he wishes to attempt to show the extent of his power.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:41.320
It is laughable, yet quite interesting.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.470
Next to battle will be Kiba Leader, Risty.

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:49.020
She shall face Lightning General, Claudette.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.830
Let us completely erase all hindrances, no matter how small.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:58.640
And the Vagrant Warrior, Leina, versus Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe, huh?

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:04.220
I have something to discuss with that Hinomoto woman personally upon our meeting.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.040
Just a little longer...

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:10.370
If we continue with these matches, we will certainly find her.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:14.110
Be at ease, my beloved Aldra.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.840
I fear that the Count will attempt to take advantage...

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:28.450
of the final stages of Queen's Blade, and travel here with his troops.

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:33.860
If I haven't strengthened my resolve by then...

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:48.910
To battle!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.440
My Count...

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:57.290
All the lords have been mobilized and are awaiting your command.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:00.690
Terrible news!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:03.490
Queen's Blade is being held here at the castle!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:04.860
What?

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.000
Damn you, Queen!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.430
I see.

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.780
So you're hindering the Count?

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:16.870
You've thought up something quite interesting.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:25.340
It seems that we are destined to cross paths.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.570
Welcome back, master.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.570
Welcome back, master.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:50.950
I'll devotedly and wholeheartedly serve you from now on.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:50.950
I'll devotedly and wholeheartedly serve you from now on.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.040
But we have to postpone that for a bit.

